{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山のコメントありがとーございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん！まあやの質問堪えてくれてThank You"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツバメを飼ってるよ！(ツバメの巣がる)\nってかたがいてびっくり！\nまさかツバメが出るとは"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"死んだときに可愛そうだから"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってかたもいらっしゃいましたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"確かにほんとーにそうです。\n命があるから最後は別れがあります。\n生き物を飼うと言うのは大変です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一生を幸せに生きてほしくて、沢山の思い出を残してあげたくて、大事に大事に育てて......。\n飼ってる内に気づくこと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生き物が沢山私に教えてくれること"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言葉は通じないけど、心があるば通じます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これも私の可愛い可愛いペットちゃんがおしえてくれました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、遅れたけど誕生日おめでとー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みゅーみゅー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも、おもしろくて、頑張りやさんなみゅーみゅー大好きよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよろしくね！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結構前の写真ですみません。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーメンバー紹介"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川村真洋\n名前の由来は真夏の太平洋のような広い心をもった、温かい女の子だそうです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとーにそのままの大好きなろってぃーちゃんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやもそんな素敵な人になりたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後陽菜\nきゃりーぱみゅぱみゅちゃんが大好きで、最近は着る服もきゃりーちゃんになってきている"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(例)\n1、ペロペロキャンディを食べもしないのに頭に刺している。\n2、音楽を聞く気ないのに、ヘッドホンを首にかけている。\n3、ハマるとめっちゃハマる！\nあっ！最後のは関係ないか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衛藤美彩\n一言で言うと、\nしっかりものです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やるときはやるし、\nちゃんと、悪いことは悪いと言えるしっかりもののお姉ちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、ボディータッチが激しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミスマガもあって、大変だと思うけど、がんばってねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"永島聖羅\nまあやが、レコーディング室に忘れ物をしたとき、\nレコーディング後も用事があり、\n次の用事の集合場所も同じで 、\nまあやは早く終って、次の集合場所にいて、ラリンが、まだ、レコーディング室だったから、\n『まあや忘れ物をしたから持ってきてー(>_<)』\nっていったら、\n『まあやのためにも成長してほしいから、自分でとりにきて！』\nって言われたとき、最初は、\n嫌だったけど、ちゃんと考えれば、ありがとー！\nっておもった。\nまあやのため思って、そういうことしてくれて嬉しかった。\nしっかりしたお姉ちゃんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"樋口日奈\n気づくといつも隣にいるひなちま"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"将来の話などしたときは、\n中学生とは思えんほど、大人っぽい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っておもった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けどたまに子供だなーって思う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも沢山お話しようね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お互いがんばろー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大和里菜\nめっちゃ綺麗な黒髪でサラサラヘアー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近染めたいっていってる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もったいない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とまたんは、まあやのほんとーのお姉ちゃんなの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知らんかったじゃろー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダイエット！ダイエット！っていってるけど、今日も一人でアイス屋さん行ってるの知ってるんだゾッ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"柏幸奈\nまあやのお母さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも変顔ばかりしててビックリ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は変顔のレベルがめっちゃ上がってる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛らしくしてくださいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、自分では気づいてないかもだけど\nたまにきゅーに声のボリュームがデカイ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"畠中せいら\n見た目はギャルに見える"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言葉使いもやることも"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも！中身を知っていくことで好きになる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなお姉ちゃんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも沢山知っていきたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後！しょっちゅうせいたんは爪がおれたー！っていってる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる\n今日のホテルは同じ部屋だった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく寝顔がひどいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うへへ\nそして寝起きが怖い"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和田\n『もうそろそろ起きてー』\n斎藤\n『あぁ？まだじゃし！』\n和田\n『おいていくよー』\n斎藤\n『はぁ？あぁ？んー』\nみたいな！でも、かわいーよ！\nまあやのこと\n『まーやさーん』\nっていってくれる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまで"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また次を期待してください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では！\nスタジアムライブ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ってきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/30/1897080/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はチョーハイテンションです！\n盛り上げてきます\nbye ＼(^o^)／"}],"source":"archive"}